/**
 * Performs foreign key inference on an array of ObjDigests, each representing a table of data. ForeignKeyInferrer#infer
 * will output a result of its best effort to find all viable Primary Key-Foreign Key candidate pairs between the given
 * tables.
 * @see InferForeignKeyResult
 * @see InferTypeSpec
 * @see https://pdfs.semanticscholar.org/8e88/4e35148a1d0b27bd677cb4dd7ee96fc2049b.pdf (Randomness Test)
 */
type ForeignKeyInferrer mixes Inferrer<map<string, ObjDigest>, InferForeignKeyResult>
